Student Grade Tracker
*********************

Written in C. Uses a singly linked list to store and manage student records.

What it does
------------

  - Add a student  (name, ID, grade)
  - Delete a student by ID
  - List all students
  - Calculate grade average
  - Find highest and lowest grade

How to run
----------

  gcc main.c -o main
  ./main

Author
